Additional Progression:
- Add a Tolerated Culture Slot and a Tolerated Religion Slot to the Tech or Legacy tree

Italia:
- Senatorial Authority: +1 Consul Point after each Consul Election
- Inclusive Citizenship: +1 Tolerated Culture
- Caput Mundi: +10% Prestige while Rome is our capital
- Experienced Command: +2% War Power for each General Skill Level (Infantry + Ranged + Cavalry)

Sicilia:
- Mediterranean Ambition: -10% War Score when declaring war against a province within 10 Diplomatic Distance
- Bountiful Coastlines: +10% Manpower, Land Tax and Tile Output on each core coastal tile for each adjacent sea edge
- Coastal Administration: -20% Governing Cost on core coastal tiles